  "prefLabel": "Emab 102.01 Organization",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Emab 102.01 Organization.\n\n(a) The appellate board is part of the department of employment security for organizational purposes, in accordance with RSA 282-A:63.\n\n(b) The appellate board shall accept appeals in accordance with Emab 202.\n\n(c) The appellate board is comprised of the chair and vice chair, who are attorneys, 2 members representing business management, 2 members representing labor, and 2 members representing the public.\n\nSource. #10621, eff 6-10-14",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/emab100.html"
